MINOS bundled career skills — provenance and review notice
Reviewed: 2026-10-28

This distribution contains TEN distinct, real upstream SKILL.md files, copied
byte-for-byte from public repositories at the immutable commits below. None was
split into synthetic skills or attributed to an invented source. No scripts,
package installers, binaries, credentials or account integrations are included.
manifest.json records per-skill source, commit, upstream path, MIT license URL,
and SHA-256 of every bundled file relative to that skill directory. Every skill
also carries the complete original MIT LICENSE, so attribution survives copying.

